`verilator_config

// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Project-specific Verilator waivers
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// Keep this file intentionally minimal.
//
// Add a waiver only after reviewing the warning and confirming that
// the RTL behavior is intentional.
//
// Example:
//
// lint_off -rule UNUSED -file "hw/third_party/*.sv"
//
// Avoid globally disabling important diagnostics such as:
//   WIDTH
//   MULTIDRIVEN
//   UNDRIVEN
//   CASEINCOMPLETE
//   CASEOVERLAP
//

